        "text": "ADITUS Evo lists 255 MCP tools, including delete_access_classifications_by_id, delete_access_timeslots_by_id, delete_article_access_classifications_by_id, delete_article_groups_bulk, delete_article_groups_by_id, delete_articles_bulk, delete_articles_by_id, delete_articles_by_id_2, delete_booths_by_id, delete_booths_by_id_users, delete_events_bulk, and delete_events_by_id."
      }
    },
